The `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, so I can't import `http-client` here. The enrichment call also sends the raw customer question to an external host. I've removed the fetch and the http import. The output is unchanged, since the fetch result was always discarded. If the platform team wants the enrichment, the grant has to be extended in the node's `with` clause by whoever owns the graph's capability configuration.

